            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        2 Bab. 23.36—24.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.5+2CH.36.6+2CH.36.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ke Ch. 36.5-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Yeremia mu ndaalo cha Yehoyakimu okhwa Yosia, omwami owa Yuda ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Cha khu be nju eya Rekabi mala olomalome ne nabo. Nomalile, bareere mu Lukaangu lwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, obengisie mu lusiro lulalakho, mala obaelesie endali banywe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yeremia abukula Yaasania okhwa Yeremia (Yeremia aba okhwa Habasinia) ne bawandaaye, alala ne basoleeli bewe boosi ne be nju eya Rekabi boosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abareera munju ya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi mu lusiro lwe babaana ba Hanani (Hanani aba okhwa Ikidalia). Hanani aba omundu owa Wele. Lusiro olwo lwaba siimbi ne lusiro lwe babemeelesi, lundi lwaba angaaki we lusiro lwa Maaseya okhwa Shalumu, omuliindi we abuundu e khuulila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yeremia abukula bikoombe ne bibuumba bibichuule endali ara ebweeni we Barekabi mala ababoolela ali, “Nywa endali yino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali Barekabi bakobosia Yeremia bali, “Efwe se khulanywa endali yosi yosi tawe, sikila Yonatabu okhwa Rekabu kuuka wefwe akhulaka ali, ‘Enywe mukhanywakho endali namwe basoleeli benywe tawe khulwa mindali na mindali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhombakha chinju namwe mukhamiicha tawe, mukhabiaala namwe mwaba ne liruuti lie kimisabibu tawe. Ne kakhali mulamenya mu maeema mu ndaalo che bulamu bwenywe choosi nio mumenye chindaalo chingali mu sibala nisio mwaramamo nga bakwa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efwe khwaria lilaka lia kuuka wefwe Yonatabu okhwa Rekabu, khu koosi niko akhulaka, ali efwe, bakhasi befwe, basoleeli befwe ne bakhaana befwe khukhanywakho endali mu ndaalo che bulamu bwefwe choosi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi khukhombakha chinju che khumenyamo tawe. Se khuli ne kimikuunda kie kimisabibu namwe kimikuunda kie khulima tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali khwamenya mu maeema mala khwaria ne khukhola koosi niko Yonatabu paapa wefwe akhulaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali nga Nebukadinesa omwami owa Babiloni ne ebwaakala sibala siefwe khwaloma khuli, ‘Yiicha khuche e Yerusalemu sikila khwariire banamae be Bakalitayo ne banamae ba Shamu.’ Niko kakila ne khumenyile mu Yerusalemu muno.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Yeremia kamakhuwa kano: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ese Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli ndoma ndi, “Cha mala oboolele babaandu ba Yuda ne bamenywa ba Yerusalemu oli enywe se mukana khukhwekesibwa mala murie kamakhuwa kase tawe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lilaka nilio Yonatabu okhwa Rekabu alaka basoleeli bewe ali bakhanywakho endali tawe, lialiindwa mala khukhwola endaalo eya luno, se banywechanga endali tawe. Kali kario sikila baria lilaka lia kuuka wabwe. Ese namubooleele ne nilamo ne se mwandekeresiisie tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nachiililila khubarumira enywe bakholi base bang'oosi ne muboolela ndi, ‘Kaluukhana luno buli mundu khukhwama khu liba liewe limayaanu, mala mung'oone bikholwa bienywe ne mukhaloonda bawele babaandi mwabakholela ne khubasaaya tawe. Mwakhola murio mulamenya mu sibala nisio namuelesia enywe ne bakuuka benywe.’ Ne kakhali enywe se mwarekeeresia namwe mwambulila tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be nju eya Yonatabu, (Yonatabu okhwa Rekabu) baliindile lilaka nilio kuuka wabwe abaelesia, ne kakhali enywe baandu base se mwandiire ese tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako ese Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli ndoma ndi, ‘Lola ndikho ndeera khu Yuda, ne khubamenywa ba Yerusalemu bubwonoki bwoosi nibwo naloma khubareerera. Kalaba kario sikila nalomaloma khu nibo mala se barekeeresia tawe, lundi nabalanga ne se bangobosia tawe.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Yeremia aboolela be nju eya Rekabu ali, “Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli aloma ali, ‘Sikila enywe mwariire lilaka lia kuuka wenywe Yonatabu mala mwakholile koosi niko amulaka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khwako ese Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli ndoma ndi omundu se alitamba mu be lisaaye lia Yonatabu okhwa Rekabu oliikholela ese tawe.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
